StellarNet spectrometer firmware

driver/src/firmware.rs contains the EZ-USB (Cypress CY7C68013A) firmware that
StellarNet's Python driver uploads to its spectrometers when they are plugged
in. It was taken from the Intel hex embedded in stellarnet_driver3 v2.5, whose
documentation states:

